*This is the openning scene before the actual gameplay starts. It gives the rundown on the plot of the game and introduces character names and setting. 
allow the player to skip if they desire*

[SCENE START]

NARRATOR: Gadreela wakes up in a strange and unfamiliar place. It feels void of space and substance, like a vaccuum. She hears a voice...
[PRESS CONTINUE]
SARIEL: Gadreela, you have made it to our target.
[PRESS CONTINUE]
GADREELA: General Sariel? Where am I?
[PRESS CONTINUE]
SARIEL: The teleportation worked. You are on Mt. Hermon, the capital fortress of the Watchers, our nefarious captors.
[PRESS CONTINUE]
GADREELA: Ah, yes. I remember my mission now. We need no power our secret weapon, the Laseract.
[PRESS CONTINUE]
SARIEL: Yes, those vile Watchers have created several abominations, Cherubs being our primary target. The psychic energy bound to their
souls can power the Laseract enough to destroy Mt. Hermon.
[PRESS CONTINUE]
GADREELA: I am ready to bring destruction upon evil and free our people once and for all.
[PRESS CONTINUE]
SARIEL: Then go, and return here once you have collected thirty cherub souls. I will be waiting.
[PRESS CONTINUE]

[SCENE END]

